# Git Attributes — 强制 Unix (LF) 行尾
# ======================================
# 所有文本文件统一使用 LF 换行符, 避免 Windows CRLF 导致
# FLASH (Fortran), Shell 脚本, Python 等因行尾不兼容报错。

# ── 全局规则: 所有文本文件自动检测, 强制 LF ──
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── 已知二进制文件: 禁止行尾转换 ──
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.ico      binary
*.pdf      binary
*.h5       binary
*.hdf5     binary
*.tar      binary
*.tar.gz   binary
*.gz       binary
*.zip      binary
*.7z       binary
*.rar      binary
*.so       binary
*.dll      binary
*.exe      binary
*.o        binary
*.a        binary
*.mod      binary
*.avi      binary
*.mp4      binary

